From: Aspartame GTK4 migration
Subject: [PATCH] gtk4: keep one authoritative zoom action implementation

Several historical navigation patches appended duplicate ShowNeighborhood and
ShowGroup methods. Python silently used the last pair, which bypassed modal
Settings cleanup. Remove the trailing duplicates so the first implementation
with control-panel dismissal remains authoritative.

--- a/src/jarabe/view/service.py
+++ b/src/jarabe/view/service.py
@@ -175,9 +175,0 @@
-    @service.method(_DBUS_SHELL_IFACE, in_signature='', out_signature='b')
-    def ShowNeighborhood(self):
-        self._shell_model.set_zoom_level(self._shell_model.ZOOM_MESH)
-        return True
-
-    @service.method(_DBUS_SHELL_IFACE, in_signature='', out_signature='b')
-    def ShowGroup(self):
-        self._shell_model.set_zoom_level(self._shell_model.ZOOM_GROUP)
-        return True
